# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------#
# Document: .gitignore
# Description: "Shell Tracking" Strategy for Submodules & Nested Apps.
#              Tracks parent folders, ignores internal artifacts.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------#

# --- 🚀 APPS SHELL TRACKING ---
# Ensure Git sees the app folder, but ignores every single file inside it.
apps/*/*

# Ensure the root directories for each app remain visible in the tree.
!apps/*/

# Recursive catch-all for build/env artifacts across the whole project.
**/node_modules/
**/venv/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/.cache/
**/.svelte-kit/
**/.env*
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock

# --- 💾 PERSISTENT DATA & ASSETS ---
# Keep the directory structure, ignore the heavy media files.
data/coozila/outputs/*
data/coozila/sessions/*
data/coozila/exports/*
data/coozila/assets/*

# Preserve directories via .gitkeep
!data/coozila/outputs/.gitkeep
!data/coozila/sessions/.gitkeep
!data/coozila/exports/.gitkeep
!data/coozila/assets/.gitkeep

# Global Media & Log Exclusions
*.mp4
*.gif
*.wav
*.mp3
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal

# --- 🐍 PYTHON ENVIRONMENT ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
.python-version
.asdf/
.tool-versions

# --- 🖥️ OS & IDE SPECIFIC ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/